~ hero.wit — the headline + code card. Exposed as #page_hero.

#page_hero
@header(class hero)
  @div(class wrap)
    @div(class eyebrow) The document language for people who love LaTeX's output div@
    @h1 Write the paper. Not the @span(class grad) preamble span@. h1@
    @p(class sub) Wit gives you typeset-quality documents without the LaTeX tax — plain, readable source with real components, data, and cross-references. One file renders to HTML, Markdown, and print-ready PDF. p@
    @div(class cta)
      @a |class btn btn-primary| |href docs/index.html| Read the docs a@
      @a |class btn btn-ghost| |href #features| Explore features a@
      @a |class btn btn-ghost| |href https://github.com| View on GitHub a@
    div@
    @div(class code-card)
      @div(class code-head)
        @span(class dot) span@
        @span(class dot) span@
        @span(class dot) span@
      div@
      @@@pre
@div(class hero)
  @h1 Hello, @span(class grad) world span@ h1@
  A paragraph that simply reads like a paragraph.
div@
pre@@@
    div@
  div@
header@
page_hero#
